    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσάρχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>offer, present</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα τῷ ἑταίρῳ σου εἰς βοήθειαν
					προσηρξάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					168c
				</span></i>
			: so perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Βρασίδαν . .
				ἐταινίουν τε καὶ προσήρχοντο ὥσπερ ἀθλητῇ</span>
			<i>paid</i> him the <i>tributes</i> due to an athlete (for which
			see <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				30
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.121
			</span></i>.</div>
